Hi Christine,

Thank you for the discussion this morning. Attached are the issued report and=
 the anonymous seven-category count for your team. Each person is counted onc=
e; the comparison cases describe several different ways the reason was availa=
ble, or a scene in which no hold was encountered.

The recommendation is to prototype the position beside Held and how the route=
 reason, source and checked time are carried, not to change the live screen o=
r release authority. As a next check, we will ask whether people can read the=
 information and whether they mistake Unknown for a decision that the hold ma=
y be released.

The counts describe the 24 interviews and should not be taken as a proportion=
 of all dispatchers. Please let me know if a point in the report would be use=
ful to walk through with your prototype team.

Best,
Jennifer

